DESCRIPTION:NOTICE OF EXECUTIVE COMMITTEE\n\nOF THE MONROE COUNTY PLAN COMM
 ISSION\n\n \n\n \n\nPlease take notice that the Executive Committee of the
  Monroe County Plan Commission will meet Friday September 25\, 2026\, at 1
 0:30 AM via a hybrid meeting in Room 106D\, North Showers Building Governm
 ent Center\, 501 N Morton St\, Bloomington\, IN 47404 and via Microsoft Te
 ams Linked here: https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/216089187342691?p=O4VV3E
