 : 4En65gL2\n\nIf calling in\, dial +1 (872) 242-9432 and enter phone confe
 rence ID: 874642553#. Once you're connected\, dial 1 to join the meeting.\
 n\nLearn more about how to access Teams: https://support.microsoft.com/en-
 us/office/join-a-meeting-in-microsoft-teams-1613bb53-f3fa-431e-85a9-d6a91e
 3468c9?ui=en-us&rs=en-us&ad=us\n\nThe meeting will be held for the followi
 ng purpose:\n\n \n\nHousing inventory report working meeting\n\n \n\nThis 
 meeting is open to the public. This is not a public hearing. The meeting i
 s scheduled for 10:30 AM to 12:00 PM.\n\n \n\nPosted this 22nd day of Sept
 ember 2026 at 10:00 AM by Jackie N. Jelen\, Director\, Monroe County Plann
 ing Department.\n\n \n\nFor more information\, contact:\n\nJackie N. Jelen
 \, AICP\n\nDirector\n\nMonroe County Planning Department\n\n501 N. Morton 
 St.\, Suite 224\n\nBloomington\, IN 47404\n\njnester@co.monroe.in.us\n\nPh
 one: (812) 349-2560
