 n and agenda is below\, and information will be posted on the County websi
 te: https://www.in.gov/counties/monroe/\n\n \n\nA G E N D A\n\nMONROE COUN
 TY PLAT COMMITTEE\n\nof the Monroe County Plan Commission\n\n \n\nMonroe C
 ounty Planning Department\n\nHYBRID\n\n \n\nSPECIAL MEETING\n\n \n\nWhen: 
 September 30\, 2026 at 3:00 PM\n\nWhere: 501 N Morton St\, Suite 224\n\nVi
 rtual: https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/248562476913093?p=JSAKJvBioFVCTRqY
 aH\n\nMeeting ID: 248 562 476 913 093\n\nPasscode: Wm77yU2K\n\n \n\nIf cal
 ling into the video conference meeting (audio only)\, dial: +1 872-242-943
 2\n\nWhen prompted\, enter the Phone Conference ID: 225 197 415#\n\n \n\nA
 DMINISTRATIVE: None.\n\n \n\nOLD BUSINESS:        None.\n\n \n\nNEW BUSINE
 SS:\n\n1. SMN-25-6                Tieman Minor Subdivision Primary Plat   
                             \n\n                                    Plat C
 ommittee Decision.\n\n                                    Two (2) parcels 
 on 73.20 +/- acres in Perry Township\, Section 26 at\n\n5165 S Harrell RD\
 , Parcel # 53-08-26-200-015.000-008.\n\nZoned CVR\, ECO 2. Contact: dmyers
 @co.monroe.in.us\n\n \n\n2. SSS-26-4                  Krueger Sliding Scal
 e Subdivision Primary Plat                    \n\nPartial Plat Vacation\nP
 lat Committee Decision.\n\nOne (1) 22.50 +/- acres in Indian Creek Townshi
 p\, Section 5 at\n7329 S Burch RD\, Parcel #: 53-10-05-400-003.000-007.\nO
 wner: Krueger\, Nancy\nZoned: AGR. Contact: rdibaya@co.monroe.in.us\n\n \n
 \n3. SMN-26-4                Zikes Estate Major Subdivision               
