 ial Plat Vacation.\n\nRoad Width Waiver.\n\nPlat Committee Recommendation.
 \n\nOne (1) parcel on 73.58 +/- acres in Indian Creek Township\, Section 2
 1 at S Lee Philips RD. Parcel # 53-10-21-300-002.000-007.\n\nZoned AGR. Co
 ntact: drbrown@co.monroe.in.us\n\n \n\nAnyone who requires an auxiliary ai
 d or service for effective communication\, or a modification of policies o
 r procedures to participate in a program\, service\, or activity of Monroe
  County\, should contact Monroe County Title VI Coordinator Melissa Stinso
 n-Waddell\, (812) 349-7314\, mstinson-waddell@co.monroe.in.us\, as soon as
  possible but no later than forty-eight (48) hours before the scheduled ev
 ent.  Individuals requiring special language services should\, if possible
 \, contact the Monroe County Government Title VI Coordinator at least seve
 nty-two (72) hours prior to the date on which the services will be needed.
 \n\n \n\nThe meeting will be open to the public.\n\nFor more information\,
  contact:\n\n \n\nJackie N. Jelen\, AICP\n\nDirector\n\nMonroe County Plan
 ning Department\n\n501 N. Morton St.\, Suite 224\n\nBloomington\, IN 47404
 \n\njnester@co.monroe.in.us\n\nPhone: (812) 349-2560
